{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>נדרו</b> — It is possible that the people of Jerusalem said this at the time of their distress, or when the remnant of warriors girds itself, they say to one another: vow to Him and fulfill." "<b>למורא</b> — On account of fear. And Rabbi Moses said: it is an epithet, like הוא מוראכם."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 76, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:41.730150039Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}